<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The earth was once a bitter place</l><l>Till Jesus showed His smiling face;</l><l>Now joy’s begun within my soul,</l><l>’Twill last while endless ages roll.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>What matters where on earth we dwell?</l><l>On mountain top, or in the dell,</l><l>In cottage, or a mansion fair,</l><l>Where Jesus is, my joy is there.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
